# Keep the build context small and avoid copying host build output / data into the
# image (which would break the in-container restore/publish or leak local data).
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/*.user
.git/
.lan-publish/
.claude/
docs/screenshots/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
Revia/Data/*.db
Revia/Data/*-photos/
Revia/Data/game-files/
Revia.Api/data/
